; Item action: the chalice that appears after twelve crosses (room 24)
;
; The room item of room 24 (Satan !!!) at row 2, column 16 with flag $8521. It is drawn (frame 0) only while twelve
; crosses have been collected ($854D >= 12); with fewer it is not drawn. A touch takes it whatever the cross count
; (observed: with 0 crosses and Jean placed on its spot): the flag becomes $FF and the item is freed with sound effect
; 5. The flag is tested by #R$BB57 (Satan disappears in a cloud of smoke), #R$A668 (the final
; parchment appears) and #R$AE4B (the ring of crosses stops).
;
; F Carry set when Jean's box overlaps the item's box
; SP Slot address + 6 on entry (the RET of #R$A614 popped the action word at +4): the next stack word is the flag pointer (the action pops it); see #R$A5E9 for the slot layout
@label=ActionChalice
c$A734 POP HL        ; flag pointer
 $A735 LD A,(HL)     ; flag
 $A736 JR NC,$A73C   ; not touching: show it if twelve crosses
 $A738 SBC A,A       ; touching: A = $FF
 $A739 LD (HL),A     ;
 $A73A JR $A71F      ; taken: sound, free the slot
*$A73C LD A,($854D)  ; crosses collected
@isub=CP CROSSES_NEEDED
 $A73F CP $0C        ;
 $A741 JP C,$A724    ; fewer than twelve: free the slot without a sound (not drawn this frame)
 $A744 XOR A         ; frame 0
 $A745 JP $A7DB      ;
